# Raw stock masters dropped into public/ for encoding. Anything under public/ is
# deployed verbatim, so a 47MB master left here ships to every visitor. Keep the
# masters outside the repo and commit only the encoded hero-*.mp4 files.
public/videos/*-utc.mp4
